Spectrum vNext integration

Feature forecasting is adapted from Spectrum by Yangheng95 and the
ComfyUI-Spectrum-KSampler implementation (MIT License).

The SEA decision metric implements the equations described in SeaCache:
Spectral-Evolution-Aware Cache for Accelerating Diffusion Models.

Forge Neo integration, lifecycle guards, GUI, cache persistence, and
compatibility policies are maintained in this repository.
